摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Live DeepSeek V4 API peak/off-peak status widget — drop-in dsh-plugin for deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness, plus a standalone browser widget.","id":"gh:1334158914","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"deepseek-peak","slug":"YMRYMR/deepseek-peak","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-api","dsh-plugin","peak-hours"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Live DeepSeek V4 API peak/off-peak status widget — drop-in dsh-plugin for deepseek-ai/deepseek-harne"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ss, plus a standalone browser widget."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# deepseek-peak"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A drop-in dsh-plugin for the\n`deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness`\nweb UI that shows the DeepSeek V4 API's "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"current peak / off-peak pricing\nstate, lets you pause the LLM during peak hours with a queue that dr"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ains\non its own, watches your account balance, and warns you when the\nbalance drops below a threshol"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"s own, watches your account balance, and warns you when the\nbalance drops below a threshold you set."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"*The PEAK pill in the session header, the BALANCE row with the\nREFRESH and TOP UP actions, and the p"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"er-model 30-day peak/off-peak\nbar charts (v4-pro and v4-flash). The pill is amber when the\nbalance d"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rops below the configured `lowBalanceWarningUsd`\nthreshold.*"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Pill** (always visible, in the session header next to the Session\nlog button). Reads the current"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" phase from the browser clock against a\nbaked-in UTC schedule:\n- Green during off-peak windows\n- Red"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" during peak windows (2× the off-peak rate)\n- A `PRE-CUTOVER` badge while the new schedule is being "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"previewed\n- A live countdown to the next phase boundary\n- A `→ live` target arrow while pre-cutover,"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" or a `→ next phase HH:MM`\narrow after the cutover\n- A pause toggle at the right edge of the pill: w"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"hen on AND the phase\nis peak, the LLM stream is gated and user messages queue instead of\nrunning\n- *"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"*Amber border + dot + label when the account balance drops below\nthe configured `lowBalanceWarningUs"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"d` threshold** (default $1.00).\nOverrides the phase color so a low balance is visible at a glance."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Tooltip** (on hover, while the pill is open). Expands under the\npill:\n- A **BALANCE** row showin"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"g the current DeepSeek account balance\n(host-routed through `/api/peak-hours/balance` so the API key"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" never\nleaves the harness process). Two action pills on the right:\n- **REFRESH** — bypasses the 5-mi"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"n host cache AND the browser cache\nso a user who just topped up sees the new number without waiting\n"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"for the natural refresh tick.\n- **TOP UP** — opens `https://platform.deepseek.com/top_up` in a\nnew t"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ab.\n- A per-model chart card for each model the user has run in the\ntrailing 30 days (v4-pro, v4-fla"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"sh). Each card has a tiny inline\nSVG daily bar chart, 30 days wide, with peak (red) on top of\noff-pe"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"ak (green). The split is computed from each event's UTC\ntimestamp against the schedule.\n- A small le"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"gend so the peak/off-peak split is legible without a\ntooltip.\n- When the LLM is gated and the queue "},{"id":"p7s10","text":"has items, a **queue card**\nappears under the chart with one row per queued message and a\nper-row **"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"send arrow** that dispatches that single message\nimmediately (bypasses the global pause)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Settings** (registered on the existing `peak-hours` namespace in\nthe host's settings plane, expo"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"sed through `Settings → Plugins →\nPlugin configuration → Peak hours`):\n- `paused` — boolean, the sam"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"e value the pill toggle writes. Two\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install (harness plugin)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Requires:\n- A checked-out `deepseek-harness` working tree (any recent commit)\n- `node` ≥ 22.19\n- `pn"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"pm` ≥ 11 (install once with `npm i -g pnpm`)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"What the installer does (each step is idempotent and skipped if already done):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Copies `harness-plugin/` → `<harness>/packages/client/ui-peak-hours/`\n2. Adds the `ui-peak-hours`"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" row to `packages/bundle/web-app/cordis.patch.yml`\n3. Adds the workspace dep to `packages/bundle/web"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"-app/package.json`\n4. Adds the project reference to `tsconfig.client.json`\n5. Adds the path mapping "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"to `tsconfig.base.json`\n6. Runs `pnpm install` in the harness\n7. Runs `pnpm run build:lib:host` (req"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"uired for the generated Typert contracts)\n8. Runs `pnpm --filter @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-peak-hou"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"rs run bundle`\n9. Runs the harness verification gates (warnings only)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then start the harness:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Open `http://127.0.0.1:3080/`. The pill appears in the top-right of the\nsession header, **left of th"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e Session log button**."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Hard-refresh the browser (Ctrl+Shift+R) the first time so the new\n`__DSH_BOOT__` roster loads."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### What you should see"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"A compact pill, ~180 px wide, with this shape (left to right):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- `[●]` is the colored dot — green for off-peak, red for peak, **amber\nwhen the balance is below the"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" configured threshold** (overrides the\nphase color)\n- The phase label and the `PRE-CUTOVER` badge (o"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"nly during the\npre-cutover window)\n- The countdown to the next phase boundary (1 Hz tick)\n- The targ"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"et arrow: `→ live` while pre-cutover, `→ next phase HH:MM`\nafter the cutover\n- The pause switch at t"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"he right edge (red when on, gray when off)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Hover the pill"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The card expands under the pill:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **BALANCE** row — your DeepSeek account balance, with the **REFRESH**\nand **TOP UP** actions on th"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e right\n- **Per-model chart card** for each model you've used in the trailing\n30 days (typically v4-"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"pro and v4-flash). Tiny inline-SVG daily bar\nchart, 30 days wide, peak (red) on top of off-peak (gre"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"en). Day totals\nshown in the top-right of each card.\n- A small **legend** under the chart: red = pea"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"k, green = off-peak\n- If the queue has items, a **queue card** with one row per queued\nmessage and a"},{"id":"p24s6","text":" per-row send arrow for manual dispatch"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Pause-during-peak workflow"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"1. Click the pill's pause switch to the right of the countdown.\n2. While the switch is on AND the ph"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ase is peak, the next LLM stream\n(user message or subagent tool call) is gated. The harness shows\nth"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"e request as queued, and the tooltip expands to show the queue\ncard.\n3. The queue is FIFO. Each item"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" is dispatched the moment the switch\nflips off or the phase leaves peak.\n4. To dispatch a single ite"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"m without flipping the global pause, click\nthe row's per-row **send arrow** in the queue card."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Low-balance warning"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin configuration → Peak hours** and set\n`lowBalanceWarningUsd` to yo"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ur preferred floor (default `1.00`). The\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Why a plugin AND a standalone"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The harness pill is the right answer inside the harness. The standalone\nis the right answer everywhe"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"re else (a second monitor, a tablet, a\nphone browser). Both compute the same numbers from the same\na"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"uthoritative schedule, so they never disagree."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## What the source layout looks like"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
